  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "45",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 45"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "45",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Shoshannim, for the sons of Korah, Maschil, A Song of loves.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My heart is inditing a good matter: I speak of the things which I have made touching the king: my tongue",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the pen of a ready writer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou art fairer than the children of men: grace is poured into thy lips: therefore God hath blessed thee for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gird thy sword upon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thigh, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "most",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mighty, with thy glory and thy majesty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in thy majesty ride prosperously because of truth and meekness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "righteousness; and thy right hand shall teach thee terrible things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thine arrows",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sharp in the heart of the king's enemies;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "whereby",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the people fall under thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy throne, O God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for ever and ever: the sceptre of thy kingdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a right sceptre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou lovest righteousness, and hatest wickedness: therefore God, thy God, hath anointed thee with the oil of gladness above thy fellows.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All thy garments",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "smell",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of myrrh, and aloes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cassia, out of the ivory palaces, whereby they have made thee glad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kings' daughters",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "among thy honourable women: upon thy right hand did stand the queen in gold of Ophir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearken, O daughter, and consider, and incline thine ear; forget also thine own people, and thy father's house;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall the king greatly desire thy beauty: for he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy Lord; and worship thou him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the daughter of Tyre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with a gift;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the rich among the people shall intreat thy favour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king's daughter",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all glorious within: her clothing",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.45.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.45.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of wrought gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She shall be brought unto the king in raiment of needlework: the virgins her companions that follow her shall be brought unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With gladness and rejoicing shall they be brought: they shall enter into the king's palace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead of thy fathers shall be thy children, whom thou mayest make princes in all the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make thy name to be remembered in all generations: therefore shall the people praise thee for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
